  "id": "emotional-content",
  "term": "emotional content",
  "definition": "Emotional content is the emotion-related meaning carried by a stimulus or message, such as an emoji, face, picture, or word. It refers to how much feeling is conveyed and can be described in terms such as emotionality, pleasantness or unpleasantness (valence), and level of activation (arousal), often depending on context when the signal is ambiguous.",
